
# Security Research Lab

## Aim
To manage security-research code and datasets
responsibly using GitHub.

## Objectives
- Store security research code.
- Manage research datasets.
- Maintain code version history.
- Protect sensitive information.
- Follow ethical research practices.

## Tools Used
- GitHub
- Python
- Visual Studio Code

## Responsible Research
Use only authorized research data.
Do not upload passwords, API keys,
or confidential information.
